{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features a work in progress Character Creator that will come included in the full version of Amarillo's Desktop Pets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Limitless desktop pets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and spawn as many as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I've designed the Character Creator with user friendliness in mind. But even if it's pretty straightforward, I've made my best effort to offer you as many options as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modding capabilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Character Creator not only lets you apply your own custom textures to the clothes and characters themselves, but I've implemented basic VRM 0.0 support. With some adjustments, you can have almost any VRM 0.0 character in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Some interactions included</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grab characters and throw them around, pin them in place and even bully them a little using your desktop's windows. Enjoy the crazy ragdoll physics!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152580?t=1740100521","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3152580?t=1740100521","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152580/69b33725c6ebc4de20f7f14418dfac513e479758/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740100521","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152580/69b33725c6ebc4de20f7f14418dfac513e479758/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740100521","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Captions available","id":13}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"Some outfits can be considered revealing, and disabling clothing items will make characters be nude."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo features a work in progress Character Creator that will come included in the full version of Amarillo's Desktop Pets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Limitless desktop pets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Create and spawn as many as you want.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Easy to use</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">I've designed the Character Creator with user friendliness in mind. But even if it's pretty straightforward, I've made my best effort to offer you as many options as possible.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Modding capabilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Character Creator not only lets you apply your own custom textures to the clothes and characters themselves, but I've implemented basic VRM 0.0 support. With some adjustments, you can have almost any VRM 0.0 character in the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Some interactions included</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can grab characters and throw them around, pin them in place and even bully them a little using your desktop's windows. Enjoy the crazy ragdoll physics!</p>","developers":["AmarilloArts"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3094870","name":"Amarillo's Desktop Pets"},"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3152580/header.jpg?t=1740100521","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257098288,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098288/movie480.mp4?t=1740000020","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257098288/movie_max.mp4?t=1740000020"},"name":"Next Fest Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257098288/ccaa96b626700b1024704321ba8c7146255ae